{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53597","headline":"咏廿四气诗 小寒十二月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 小寒十二月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小寒连大吕，欢鹊垒新巢。\n拾食寻河曲，衔紫遶树梢。\n霜鹰近北首，雊雉隐藂茅。\n莫怪严凝切，春冬正月交。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}